Access Management Implementation 

1. accessManagement collection has data stored in following form
	{
		role: xxx,
		permissions: [
			{
				facilityName: xxx,
				create: true,
				edit: true,
				delete: false,
				view: true,
				list: true
			},
			{
				facilityName: yyy,
				create: true,
				edit: true,
				delete: false,
				view: true,
				list: true
			}
		]
	}


2. When user logins, we send UserDetails object from API and store that in LocalStorage. 
Add this accessManagement Object in this UserDetails object. 


3. On every page, take these permissions into a variable. 
	let userDetails = localStorage.getItem('userDetails');
	let permissions = userDetails.accessManagement. 

4. The access or permission given to any user is to be implemented as follows
	
	if(permissions.userManagement.list){
		<UserManagementList/>
	}

	if(permissions.userManagement.edit){
		<i className="fa-pencil"></i>
	}

	if(permissions.userManagement.delete){
		<i className="fa-trash"></i>
	}






